    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tykh](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tykh) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Nov 16 2026 95 km WSW of Changuillo, Peru. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -15.0306 longitude -76.0259. It impacted 490 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
